    },
    {
      "key": "tc88d127e9f269b46",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What You Can Trade OTC</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">场外交易可以交易什么</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4d348e25e6f73437",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">OTC trading can include several asset classes. The exact products depend on the broker’s licence, platform, and business model.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">场外交易可以包括多种资产类别。确切的产品取决于经纪商的牌照、平台和业务模式。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "teda2a0c3147984eb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stock CFDs allow you to trade on price movements in global companies without owning the underlying shares. This can include firms such as Apple, Tesla, Amazon, and others depending on the platform.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">股票差价合约允许您在不拥有标的股票的情况下根据全球公司的价格变动进行交易。这可能包括苹果、特斯拉、亚马逊等公司，以及其他公司，具体取决于平台。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t62957fa8bc0efaaa",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Crypto-Linked Products</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/otc-trading-in-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/otc-trading-in-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">加密货币相关产品</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t709f3bcefe729f38",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Bonds, Sukuk, and Structured Products</span>",
      "kind": "html",
